{"ID":"20240118145002-d4zno9l","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145002-d4zno9l","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145002-d4zno9l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145002-e1pa5mv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164947-fj2ea48\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164940-5tz5vwr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:298,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:298\u0026#125;","title":"361补04蜘蛛","type":"doc","updated":"20240204160113"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145002-e1pa5mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145002-e1pa5mv","updated":"20240122164853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生原野，处处有之，种类甚多，取大腹深灰色，空中作圆网者，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164900-4a4c1sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164900-4a4c1sa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味缺，性微寒，有小毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164901-79tnzle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164901-79tnzle"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蜘蛛主口瘑，瘰疬，结核，治蜈蚣蜂虿螫伤，宜外用，内服治干霍乱呕吐，脱肛，小儿大腹疳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164903-mcmuz1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164903-mcmuz1r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】小儿大腹丁奚，三年不能行者。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164904-9zbho4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164904-9zbho4j"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】蜈蚣蜂虿螫人，取置咬处吸其毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164906-igew8vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164906-igew8vm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】主蛇毒，温疟，止呕逆霍乱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164907-acrxmim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164907-acrxmim"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】取汁涂蛇伤，烧啖治小儿腹疳。[肚子里有虫，中医一般是以虫治虫。]"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164908-d9oyj54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164908-d9oyj54"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】斑者治疟疾疔肿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164910-3bndn32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164910-3bndn32"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164912-mqemmfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164912-mqemmfr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】有毒之物，可外用，少内服。凡使，去头足用，落在饮食中者不可食，畏蔓青雄黄，被蜘蛛咬中毒者，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164921-bukn7mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164921-bukn7mv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（一）用大篮汁一碗，入雄黄麝香少许，搽患处，仍服其汁。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164922-af6404p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164922-af6404p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（二）用艾叶烧烟熏之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164923-sch9h7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164923-sch9h7b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（三）羊乳灌之。（四）雄黄末敷之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164843-dvccopp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164843-dvccopp","updated":"20240122164845"}},{"ID":"20240122164924-ntltvqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164924-ntltvqv","updated":"20240204155938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第四个，是蜘蛛。一般来说这个蜘蛛要找，在产地你看"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"取大腹，深灰色，腹部是深灰色，越大肚子鼓得越大而且深灰色的，织那个网是圆形的那个蜘蛛最好。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你要去房檐采蜘蛛不要乱采，要看肚子很大的灰色的，网是圆形的采回来，入药，那这个我们经方呢有用蜘蛛，它是规定要用屋子的西南角，所以你要拿个罗盘去测，不要找东南角。西南角的蜘蛛，张仲景有些药很好玩，我们在后面要介绍甘李根白皮要找东南角的一根，所以你要拿罗盘去测看东南角在哪里。当然你是植物学家，你看叶子怎么长，叶子都跟着太阳走嘛对不对，所以叶子怎么长你大概知道东南角在哪个位置上，专门讲到李腹根，西南角的那个蜘蛛，那这个蜘蛛，西南角的蜘蛛在房屋的西南角那边结网的蜘蛛，把它采回来那就是我们要的那个蜘蛛。"}]},{"ID":"20240122164940-5tz5vwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164940-5tz5vwr","updated":"20240204160113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那蜘蛛散，很有名的蜘蛛散，我们知道疝气，寒疝顽痛，这里的蜘蛛呢，主口喎眼斜，瘰疬，喉那个结淋巴肿大，还有蜈蚣咬伤，脱肛，都可以，你看小儿大腹丁奚三年不能行，这个肚子肿大在那边，不能走路。这个苏颂呢：烧啖治小儿腹疳，其实这种都是肚子很肿大，这里讲的都是什么，寄生虫，我们会用虫类的东西，一定去抗虫，对抗这个虫子。那蜘蛛，蜘蛛很凶嘛，它要对抗虫，一般来说都是肚子里面有虫，长虫，你如果说真的肚子里面有虫，我们有很多打虫药，中药里面有非常多的打虫药，都可以使用，这方面你如果用吃西药的打虫药我倒不反对，为什么，因为打虫而已嘛，打完虫就不会吃嘛，每天都吃打虫药，你哪那么多虫啊，对不对，打一次两次就够了，那中药也有打虫药，这个我不反对。这个后面的禁忌书上有，这个诸位看看啊"}]},{"ID":"20240122164947-fj2ea48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164947-fj2ea48"}}]}